						<label>[resource_displayname[ToolbarMarkup]]</label>
						<div >
							<input name="toolbar" />
						</div>
					</li>
				</ul>
			</div>
		</div>
		<p>
			if you want to include a field in the OData query that the grid uses then make sure that the 'Select' column is checked,
			As long as it's selected you can use it in the template of any column.
			If you do not want to see that column but have it selected for any reason then you can check the 'hide' column and the column will not appear in the final grid.
		</p>
		<div class="container">
			<div name="selects" >
				<div name="grid"></div>
			</div>
		</div>
